## 3. Experiment Result

### **FAIL**

### Technical Explanation
Stripping `QtWebEngine/6.11.1` from the User-Agent header is **insufficient to enable Google OAuth on Claude.ai**.

Google Identity Services (GSI SDK) invokes Chromium's C++ FedCM UI Delegate (`IdentityRequestDialogController`). In QtWebEngine's embedded C++ architecture, Chromium's native desktop FedCM UI account picker dialog is un-implemented / unavailable. `navigator.credentials.get()` rejects with `NetworkError: Error retrieving a token` regardless of the HTTP User-Agent header.

